mmendationid": "14583035", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976908249", "personaname": "Jess", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dathotshot/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 19008, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8745, "last_played": 1533519550, "avatar": "913f2f224f78d0be14ae0829a12c08e353ac7322"}, "language": "english", "review": ">To my right was Bly as Nova with a huge-ass sword. \n>To my left was Sir Butters as Nekros with an axe. \n> I am Volt with Paris Prime\n> Bly yells \"FOR FRODO\"\n> We charge.\n\n10/10 Would be Space Legolas again.", "timestamp_created": 1424552557, "timestamp_updated": 1424552557, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 474, "votes_funny": 1399, "weighted_vote_score": "0.694724559783935547", "comment_count": 24, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "14582960", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121927443", "personaname": "Dero", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nightTDK/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 22742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3336, "last_played": 1611608460, "avatar": "91031ee63283098d3ffb3c35ac8e2e033e1bc34e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is a uniqe game featuring diffrent and uniqe weaponry, a cool universe to explore and so on.\nWarframe is rly uniqe but of course every gem has its flaws. The story ... well there isnt much to say a pretty common story \nsaving the galaxy and so on. The game features co-op which is cool and all but it can get pretty boring as 1 player is diffucult, 2 players is chalanging, 3 players OK, 4 players TOO EASY. Bosses arent much special, yes they are chalanging but once you find theyre weaknes it gets too easy (Exept one on saturn). As for  enemies 3 races one is like the old empire trying to survive, the second is more futuristic, and the third is like muteted enemies wich you see in game (there is another race but its basecly all 3 races put to gether).\nOver all: \nGameplay-9/10 a lot of features to make the game intresting\nStory-6/10 it would deserve a five at least but there is a special intresting character that is gets you wondering who he \n            is (Stalker)\nGraphics-not my teritory but 8.5/10 too much blur\nCo-op gameplay-7/10 it isnt easy finding a good squad or a server but once you do it gets too easy\nEnemies-8.5/10 Creative but not the smartest you can sprint behind an enemy and still without him noticing you\nOverall-8.5/10 The bigest problem that it can get rly repetitev and quick but the dev are still updating the game and a lot so I hope they will fix the problems.\n              \n                    \n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1424552285, "timestamp_updated": 1424552285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14582644", "author": {"steamid": "76561198177160259", "personaname": "76561198177160259", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198177160259/", "num_games_owned": 1, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 297, "last_played": 1424439791, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a good game. If the producers thought about adding PvP part of the game, it would become better.", "timestamp_created": 1424551084, "timestamp_updated": 1424551084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "we